permission and warranty notice reproduced above applies to these contributions.

Enhanced temporal and spatial postprocessing
==========================================

The YCoCg variance clipping, Halton jitter and Catmull-Rom temporal reconstruction
in crates/ao-render/src/taa.wgsl and temporal.rs adapt rvk/shaders/taa.frag
and rvk/hdr.cpp from ao-vk, https://github.com/wannabuh/ao-vk, revision
a0dc47ea2c853d26a4491d5a25ef0331f714b6ce.
The display-space FXAA, contrast-adaptive sharpening, golden-angle bokeh gather
and motion-blur gather in crates/ao-render/src/{fxaa,cas,depth_of_field,motion_blur}.wgsl
adapt rvk/shaders/{fxaa.frag,sharpen.frag,dof_common.glsl,dof_gather.frag,motion_blur.frag}
from the same revision. Copyright (c) 2026 wannabuh; the full MIT permission and
warranty notice above applies to these ports. Exact native pose motion, per-tap
admission identity validation, own-character focus and current-frame depth guards
are specific to this renderer.

Native foliage and recovering grass trails
==========================================

The split foliage core/edge partition, damped spring-back response, canopy sprig
and gust-falling leaf construction, and recovering trail field in
crates/ao-render/src/foliage*.{rs,wgsl} and grass.{rs,wgsl} are ports/adaptations
of ao-vk's rvk/draw.cpp, leaves.cpp, grass.cpp and shaders/ffp.vert,
ffp_main.glsl, sway.glsl, wind.glsl and grass.vert.
Source: https://github.com/wannabuh/ao-vk (MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 wannabuh).
The MIT permission and warranty notice above applies to these adaptations.
Visible-sprig density, two-sided transmission/forward scattering, branch-scale
wind, tumbling descent and ground-rest/shrink motion were revisited against
revision 53b6881eccd80b6d5887826106644ae7e7de3a44, including the changed-course
canopy-plan.md notes. Native textures remain runtime-only; no upstream artwork
or proprietary client asset is redistributed.
Native resource-name classification, current-frame source admission/revocation,
world-anchored stabilized wind, unchanged original canopy coverage and bounded
native topology refinement are specific to this renderer. No client assets are
redistributed.

Enhanced authored-material specular
==================================

crates/ao-render/src/authored_specular.wgsl ports PbrSpecular (GGX distribution,
height-correlated Smith visibility, Schlick Fresnel and the game's pi-scaled
light units) from ao-vk rvk/shaders/lighting.glsl at commit
a0dc47ea2c853d26a4491d5a25ef0331f714b6ce:
https://github.com/wannabuh/ao-vk/blob/a0dc47ea2c853d26a4491d5a25ef0331f714b6ce/rvk/shaders/lighting.glsl
Copyright (c) 2026 wannabuh, distributed under the MIT License reproduced above.
Authored shininess conversion and derivative normal-variance AA are this
project's adaptations; no invented material or environment-reflection assets
are used.

Enhanced moonlight
==================

The optional moon-shadow path shares the directional blocker-search and
Vogel-disk filter adapted from ao-vk's rvk/shaders/ffp_main.glsl
(https://github.com/wannabuh/ao-vk), credited above under Soft sun-shadow filter.
Copyright (c) 2026 wannabuh, under the MIT License; the complete copyright,
permission and warranty notice reproduced above applies. Native moon tracks,
fog extinction and current-frame actor admission remain this renderer's inputs.
